  "comment": "@kubb/* is pinned to an exact version on purpose. The generated client under src/services is committed, and CI asserts that regenerating it leaves the working tree clean; a caret range lets a patch release change the generator output and turn that check red for reasons unrelated to the API. The enterprise workspace that consumes this project as a submodule pins the same version, so both repos regenerate byte-identical clients.",
